# Testing

- Tests must be **deterministic** and run with `LLM_PROVIDER=mock`.
- Mock/stub external APIs — no paid OpenAI/Anthropic/Gemini, Salesforce, or live GitHub calls in the default suite.
- Seed reference DB fixtures in-test; do not depend on `references/references.db` contents.
- Cover approval blocking export and brand/QA failing closed where applicable.
- Run `./scripts/test.sh` (or `uv run pytest -q`) after behavior changes.
- Prefer focused unit tests plus one mocked end-to-end journey under `tests/e2e/`.
